    "body": "https://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/blob/master/share/functions/prevd-or-backward-word.fish\r\n\r\nIt seems that fish uses `commandline -f repaint` to tell the shell to repaint the prompt--my guess is that this suffers from the same issue as the zsh issue where prompt commands are not being run before the repaint. It's not as clear to me how to fix this one.",
