    "updated_at": "2019-09-26T12:15:22Z",
    "body": "I think that starship *is* being run since the path is updated, it's just that it's shorter than it was previously. I'm not sure what is really possible in a terminal but if a line could be cleared before printing or alternatively cleared to the end of the line then starship could do that every time to avoid having old stuff printed in the prompt line.",
